 "_note": "Route 3 (#100). Ablate a component in a post-crossing pythia-410m, re-measure lambda_ca with dev_transition_phase3.measure driven UNCHANGED via an ARRule patch, and ask whether the drop exceeds what the ablation's held-out loss cost predicts. Raw drops are meaningless here -- zeroing all MLPs costs 2.5x the loss that zeroing all attention does -- so SELECTIVITY is the measurement. A null closes the explanandum programme: it would mean lambda_ca is a loss proxy under intervention."
